'''Tangleburg''' is a [[Location]] on the {{Zone|Moonglade Marsh}} in {{Zone|Galatea}}.

== Purpose ==
'''Tangleburg''' serves as an introductory spot for {{Zone|Galatea}} and its various mechanics. Players are first instructed to speak with {{NPCSprite|Hina}}, who unlocks the {{Item|Heart of the Forest}}, a skill tree that grants various [[Foraging]]-related perks. After then speaking to {{NPCSprite|Swoop}} and learning about {{Stat|sweep}}, players can start {{NPCSprite|David Hunterborough}}'s quest, who explains {{Skill|Hunting}} and [[Attributes]].

